events.message:
0.7.0: quick save slots, recording, on-screen keyboard, profiler, graphics finder, joypads

From dev 0d47276:
- quick save slots (Ctrl+1..9 load, Ctrl+Shift+1..9 save, Undo the last load);
- video and sound recording: AVI (MJPEG or lossless ZMBV) and WAV, File > Record, --record;
- the on-screen CPC keyboard (464, 664, 6128, Plus; UK, French, Spanish);
- the code profiler and the graphics finder;
- real joysticks and joypads with redefinable buttons, Plus analogue mode;
- CPC or PC keyboard layout; recent files;
- the version in the title bar and the About window; the author credited.

CMake: src/gui/gui_profiler.cpp, gui_gfx_finder.cpp and gui_keyboard.cpp.
README: the new features, keys and options.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Take this PC's private paths out of the repo

AMIGA found in /opt/amiga or ~/opt/amiga (overridable) in both Makefiles;
compile_flags.txt no longer tracked, `make compile_flags.txt` writes it;
test scripts find CTerm's rig through CTERM_DIR (default: the sibling repo);
uae030.sh takes AmiSSL from $AMISSL; docs use relative paths.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Workbench help goldens and render test follow the plainer help wording

Seven help texts now differ from upstream only by dropping "honest";
they are listed in DEVIATIONS with the reason.

Remove process history from the repository content

The repository describes the ROMs as they are; how the disassembly
was produced belongs in git history. Removed:
- progress, phase, review, punchlist and open-issue trackers
  (4.21, 4.24-4.26), the 4.21 working notes superseded by
  CHANGES-FROM-4.18.md, and the 4.25 bootstrap prompt;
- the comment-format sweep tracker and its scanner;
- the 4.08.53 label-mapping and 3.34 correspondence outputs;
- the commented-out "# UNMAPPED:" parent annotations left in the
  4.24-4.26 drivers (no change to the generated output);
- the py8dis label and stale-label narrative in the authors
  easter-egg analysis, which now describes the current labelling.

